### Get all feature flags current organitzation
GET https://localhost:8443/api/feature-flags
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Get feature flags rules by flagId 
GET https://localhost:8443/api/feature-flags/argentinacompliance
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Insert or Save a feature flag
POST https://localhost:8443/api/feature-flags
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
	"flagId": "Afi",
	"orgId": 1,
	"flagState": true,
	"modifierUserId": 1692 
}

### Delete feature flag row WHERE param :flagId and request.body.orgId
DELETE https://localhost:8443/api/feature-flags/Afi
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
	"orgId": 1
}